@startuml sd-05-cancel-request
' SD-05 - cancelRequest (CO5)
' Linked to: UC01 exception 5a, SSD-01 outer alt, CO5, minimal guarantee, SC05
title SD-05 – cancelRequest() (CO5)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber

participant ":StudentUI" as UI <<UI layer>>
participant ":SubmitPlacement\nRequestHandler" as H <<controller>>
participant "r : Request" as R
participant ":RequestRepository" as RR <<port>>

UI -> H : cancelRequest()
activate H
H -> H : inProgress = null
destroy R
note right of R
  CO5 postconditions:
  links from r to Student and Opportunity broken;
  r deleted (no references remain).
end note
note over RR
  Not called. r was never saved,
  so nothing is recorded (minimal guarantee).
end note
H --> UI : submission cancelled
deactivate H
@enduml
